  m_functionName: 
  m_description: 'Samples VRC Light Volumes and returns color.


    World Position
    Offset only applies to Light Volumes sampling, not the Point Light Volumes. It''s
    useful to apply some bias offset by sprcifying a value which is WorldNormal *
    Bias'
